 "Check that ",
 StyleBox["LoopMeasure[d, aq]",
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.12, 0.1],
  Background->GrayLevel[0.92]],
 " integrates to the volume of the unit ball over (2",
