  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ")^d: ",
 StyleBox["\[Integral]\:2080\.b9",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 " LoopMeasure daq = V_d/(2",
 StyleBox["\[Pi]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 ")^d with V_d = ",
 StyleBox["\[Pi]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "^{d/2}/",
 StyleBox["\[CapitalGamma]",
  FontFamily->"Noto Sans"],
 "(d/2 + 1), for d = 3."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0519af04-7936-4122-9b27-8875c2eddf24"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Solution", "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"6ad7f490-e972-4d23-a2a3-78c651183d78"],

Cell["\<\
{Integrate[LoopMeasure[3, aq], {aq, 0, 1}], Pi^(3/2)/Gamma[5/2]/(2 Pi)^3}\
\>", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"d1b59c1f-c836-4ce8-885d-61c7403a026f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Both are 1/(6",
